# ❓ Question Answering System using Transformers

## Overview

This project implements a Question Answering (QA) system that extracts answers from a given context using transformer-based language models.

The application demonstrates one of the most common Natural Language Processing (NLP) tasks and serves as a foundation for Retrieval-Augmented Generation systems.

---

## Features

* Context-based question answering
* Transformer models
* Fast inference
* Interactive interface
* Easy model replacement

---

## Tech Stack

* Python
* Hugging Face Transformers
* PyTorch
* Streamlit

---

## Project Workflow

Context + Question → Transformer Model → Predicted Answer

